The plate is a square white plate, about 22 cm across the diagonal-ish span (roughly 20–22 cm per side). The scrambled eggs cover about 12 cm × 11 cm and are about 3 cm high in places. That is roughly 150–170 g of eggs.

The shredded cheddar sits on top as a thin layer over a small area, about 15 g. There is also a salsa or ketchup-like red sauce under and among the cheese, about 25 g.

